    "Feedback is the user's choice c_t among the offered assortment (or no-purchase) drawn from a multinomial logit model with item utilities v_i = theta*^T x_i; reward is the known price r_i of the chosen item, expected reward R(S,v) = sum v_i r_i / (1 + sum v_i) (non-monotone)",
