   "definition_quote": "In MNL-Bandit, at each time step $t$, the player selects a subset $\\overline{S}_t\\in\\mathcal{C}\\left(\\mathcal{S}\\right)=\\{S|S\\subseteq\\mathcal{S},|S|\\leq K\\}$ and observes the user choice $c_t\\in \\overline{S}_t\\cup \\{0\\}$ ... linear item utility is introduced where item utility is a linear function of item feature, $v_i=\\bm{\\theta}^{*\\top}\\mathbf{x}_i$. Assumption 1: $\\forall i\\in\\mathcal{S}, r_i\\leq 1, \\|\\mathbf{x}_i\\|\\leq 1, \\|\\bm{\\theta}^*\\|\\leq 1$."
